GIBox licensing
===============

This repository contains code ported from 3DMigoto (XXMI fork): the INI
command-list logic core in app/src/main/cpp/migoto/. 3DMigoto is licensed
under the GNU General Public License, version 3. The combined work, GIBox as
built from this repository from that point on, is therefore distributed under
the GNU General Public License, version 3. The full text is in COPYING.

Where the ported code came from, at which upstream commit, and what was changed
is recorded in third_party/3dmigoto/README.md, together with the upstream
license statement (third_party/3dmigoto/COPYING.txt) and author list
(third_party/3dmigoto/AUTHORS.txt).

GIBox code contributed before the port (up to and including commit 971cb16)
was contributed under the MIT License reproduced below. That notice is kept
unchanged and still applies to those contributions; anyone may continue to use
those parts on their own under the MIT terms, provided the notice is kept. The
MIT License is compatible with the GPLv3, so it does not restrict distributing
the combined work under the GPLv3. Contributions made after the port are made
under the GPLv3.

A release (APK or other binary) built from this repository must be accompanied
by, or offer, the complete corresponding source: this repository at the
release's commit, including the build scripts (Gradle and CMake files, tools/)
and the third-party sources or the exact versions the build fetches, as listed
in THIRD_PARTY.md (GPLv3 section 6).

